<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for the Digimon Master Online 
auto kill macro can be use on every map


Screen Resolution : Full Screen 1920x1080

Shortcut in game setting:
Skill shortcut is F1 ( recomended to use powerfull skill 1 digimon)
HP shortcut is F6
DS shortcut is 8


line 1 for find digimon
line 5  for check digimon health
line 6  for attack with skill 1
line 10 to check target digimon died or not
line 11 to heal HP
line 17 to heal DS

</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 111 ms
GoColor 1 0 177,48,35 255,255,255 2 946 52 28 7 1 0
KeyDown 58 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 58 1
Delay 111 ms
GoColor 6 1 177,48,35 255,255,255 2 829 52 1 7 1 0
GoColor 13 0 129,34,24 255,255,255 2 205 124 2 7 1 0
Goto 17
KeyDown 63 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 63 1
Delay 111 ms
GoColor 19 0 0,105,231 255,255,255 2 130 138 2 7 1 0
Goto 22
KeyDown 37 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 37 1
Delay 111 ms
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Digimon Masters Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>